  "dossier": "Wrote 16 letters from Massa, Naples, St. [illegible] (1624–1643) petitioning the General for the foreign missions; requested destinations: East Indies (11), China (3), West Indies (1), Asia (1).",
  "letters": [
   {
    "n": 57,
